    "title": "The Madison Season 2: Release Date, Story, & Everything We Know",
    "text": "Paramount Press Published Mar 21, 2026, 12:00 PM EDT Ana Dumaraog is a Writer and Editor at Screen Rant, where she expertly covers Network TV offerings, among other things She has spearheaded the effort to make the site an authority on broadcast shows, initially starting with The Big Bang Theory franchise, NCIS, and One Chicago before taking on the specialization in general. Ana has also covered a wide-spread of topics in the past — from franchises like, the MCU and Star Wars, to classic TV favorites, such as Frasier and MASH. Ana brings clarity and enthusiasm to every story she tackles—whether reporting on new releases or offering deep dives into fan-favorite franchises. Her coverage translates complex entertainment developments into engaging, audience-focused content. Sign in to your Screen Rant account The Madison ends with some changes in the horizon for the Clyburns and setting up more to come moving forward. Taylor Sheridan expands his neo-Western portfolio by introducing a brand-new family to Montana following the Dutton clan. Streaming on Paramount+, The Madison is part of the creator's post-Yellowstone plan of launching several more shows, joining CBS's Marshals with Luke Grimes' Kayce and the upcoming Dutton Ranch show featuring Cole Hauser and Kelly Reilly's Rip and Beth. The Madison Season 2 Hasn't Been Confirmed At Paramount via MovieStillsDB Officially, neither Sheridan nor Paramount+ has officially confirmed that the Clyburns are coming back for The Madison season 2. The show just finished its run, and while it immediately became a streaming success for the streamer when it premiered its first three episodes, it's possible that the platform is still waiting for data to make an announcement. When Could The Madison Season 2 Release? via MovieStillsDB Since filming for The Madison season 2 is supposedly complete, its release will be highly dependent on Paramount+ and how it maps out the rest of the next year. It's also worth mentioning that Sheridan's other shows in his streaming portfolio will have an impact on this decision. What The Madison Season 2'ss Story Will Be Paramount Press The final half of The Madison season 1 saw the Clyburns deal with the burial of Preston and Paul in Stacy's Valley. After that, the family ended up going back to New York in an effort to move forward with their lives, with the episodes showing how everyone was coping with the loss. Stacy started going to therapy while Paige got fired after hitting someone at work for saying something crass about her father. On the other hand, Abby dealt with the unexpected end of her relationship with Van. Related The Madison's Robert Redford Tribute Explained At the end of The Madison's first episode is a tribute to Robert Redford. Despite not being involved in the project, the actor is vital to the show. Beyond Stacy and Preston's family, The Madison season 2's organic expansion includes exploring other characters' stories. Paul's life remains largely unknown, bar a few revelations about his personal history. There's also Cade and his family, as well as Van's own narrative, especially if the plan is for him to continue having this romantic arc with Abby. Release Date March 14, 2026 Network Paramount Network Cast Michelle Pfeiffer Stacy Clyburn Patrick J. Adams Russell McIntosh The Madison is a heartfelt examination of grief and human connection, centering on a New York City family navigating personal struggles in the Madison River valley of central Montana.",
